@hiero-ledger/sdk

    The Hiero JavaScript SDK, Apache 2.0, copyright Hedera Hashgraph LLC and
    the Hiero contributors, from https://github.com/hiero-ledger/hiero-sdk-js

    The one dependency the consensus topic added. A contract in the Hedera EVM
    cannot submit to a topic, so `venue/tools/hcs-topic.mjs` and
    `venue/tools/hcs-relay.mjs` sign a native TopicCreateTransaction and
    TopicMessageSubmitTransaction, which needs the SDK. It is installed in
    toolchain/ and reached only from venue/tools/. It is not vendored, it is
    not inlined into any page, and `venue/tools/gen-app.mjs` inlines a fixed
    list that does not include it, so the six built screens still carry no
    dependency but the vendored ethers above.

    toolchain/package.json pins three `overrides` on its behalf: protobufjs to
    ^8.8.0, ws to ^8.21.3, and the versions those imply. They are there so
    adding the SDK did not add a published advisory to the tree. `npm audit`
    reports the same eighteen findings before and after, all of them in the
    pre-existing snarkjs and circomlibjs chains, none of them with a fix
    available.
